      "category": "Text",
      "text": "With respect to employees in the Department of Welfare in titles covered by the collective bargaining contracts entered into by the City and Local 371, AFSCME, and District Council 37, AFSCME and the Social Service Employees Union (Independent), for the period 1/1/65 to 12/31/66, and in accordance with the terms thereof, the following provisions shall govern grievance procedures as an alternate to Step 4 of paragraph 7 of Executive Order 49 of the Mayor, issued March 31, 1958:",
