    {
      "bbox": [
        299,
        2395,
        1807,
        2650
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If, after completion of Step 3 of the grievance steps provided in Executive Order No. 49, the grievance or complaint has not been resolved within the Department of Welfare, the grievant, or the union on his behalf, may appeal from said step 3 determination to an arbitrator for decision as provided hereinafter.",
